          "dense_rank": 1,
          "lexical_score": 4.627869,
          "lexical_rank": 2,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What are your clinic hours and locations?\nAnswer: We are open Monday through Saturday from 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM at 15a Willson St. The nearest free parking is a 3-minute walk away at the Mega Mall parking garage (9 Willson St.).",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 37,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": 0.27166575,
          "dense_rank": 2,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# General practice services\n## Medical examinations for work, driving and sport\n\nWe do not carry out commercial driver (DOT) medical examinations, pilot medicals or immigration medical examinations. A sports physical before joining a team or a competition is done in a standard GP appointment.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 26,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.25352475,
          "dense_rank": 3,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: When is payment due, and what payment methods do you accept?\nAnswer: Payment is due at the time of service. We accept cash, major credit and debit cards (Visa, Mastercard, American Express), and Flexible Spending Account (FSA) / Health Savings Account (HSA) cards.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 22,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.24774761,
          "dense_rank": 4,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Do you offer virtual or telehealth consultations?\nAnswer: No, we currently only offer in-person visits at our clinic location.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 33,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.24688111,
          "dense_rank": 5,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Running late\n## If you are running late\n\nCall the front desk on (212) 555-0142 as soon as you know you will be late, so we can tell the practitioner and plan around it. The phone line is answered Monday through Saturday from 8:30 AM to 6:00 PM.\n\nIf you arrive up to 10 minutes after your appointment time, you will still be seen, but the appointment may be shorter so that the patients booked after you are not kept waiting. If you arrive more than 15 minutes late for a GP or specialist appointment, or more than 10 minutes late for a dental appointment, we may not be able to see you, and you will be asked to choose a new time. Dental appointments have the shorter limit because the treatment room has to be prepared and cleaned between patients.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 35,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.24500494,
          "dense_rank": 6,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## Language interpreters\n\nFree telephone interpreting is available in more than 200 languages for any appointment. Ask for it when you book or when you check in; there is",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 36,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": 0.22965913,
          "dense_rank": 7,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n## Questions and complaints about privacy\n\nOur privacy officer answers questions about how your information is used and handles privacy complaints. Ask the f",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 34,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.22045997,
          "dense_rank": 8,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Phone calls\n\nIf we cannot reach you by phone, we leave a voicemail with only the clinic's name, a callback number and your first name - never th",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 32,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.21678919,
          "dense_rank": 9,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Vaccinations\n## Travel vaccinations\n\nBook a travel vaccination appointment at least six weeks before you leave, because some vaccines need more than one dose or take time to become effective. Bring ",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 36,
