          "dense_rank": 20,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# General practice services\n## Long-term conditions\n\nIf you live with a long-term condition such as type 2 diabetes, high blood pressure, asthma or COPD, your GP will agree a regular review schedule w",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 33,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.19651829,
          "dense_rank": 21,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Running late\n## If the clinic is running late\n\nSometimes an earlier appointment takes longer than planned. If your practitioner is running more than 20 minutes behind, the front desk will tell you w",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 24,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.19396487,
          "dense_rank": 22,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What should I do if my insurance isn't listed or I am out-of-network?\nAnswer: You can pay out-of-pocket for your visit, and we can provide you with an itemized receipt to submit to your insu",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 33,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.19342434,
          "dense_rank": 23,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Running late\n## Checking in on time\n\nCheck in at the front desk or at the self-check-in kiosk as soon as you arrive. Your arrival is recorded when you check in, not when you enter the building.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 23,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.19316506,
          "dense_rank": 24,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Which health insurance plans do you accept?\nAnswer: We accept most major insurance providers, including Blue Cross Blue Shield, Aetna, Cigna, UnitedHealthcare, and Medicare. If you're unsure",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 30,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.19197541,
          "dense_rank": 25,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Dental care guide\n## Feeling anxious about the dentist\n\nLet us know when you book or when you check in. The dentist will agree a stop signal with you - raising your left hand - and will pause whenev",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 29,
